  "title": "Employee Sub Group Payments — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PayrollManagement.EmployeeSubGroupPayment",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>A standing payment for everyone in the sub group, paid through a wagetype.</p><p>Only two pay intervals are used. <em>Yearly</em> rows are paid once a year, in their <strong>Pay Month</strong>. <em>End Of Service</em> rows are paid in the employee's end-of-service run. Rows with any other interval are not paid.</p>",
  "aliasIndex": {
